  "text": "Dictation should fit the way you work. Meet Mluva, the most delightful dictation app for Omachi. It's that simple. Press F nine, speak, press F nine again, and paste. Use the best local or cloud speech models, Whisper, ElevenLabs, or your own. Omachi moves like water. Mluva floats, tiles, and opens up to show every detail. Done talking? Edit it, polish it, rewrite it by hand or with AI. Never lose your thoughts again. Make Mluva yours, your desktop, your palette, any Omachi theme automatically. Want more? Try live rewrite. Your note takes shape as you talk. Or build a task spec with questions for what's still missing. Mluva, a little more delight every day",
